{"parse": {"title": "河港与海之间-03", "pageid": 88861, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%B2%B3%E6%B8%AF%E4%B8%8E%E6%B5%B7%E4%B9%8B%E9%97%B4-02\" title=\"河港与海之间-02\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">河港与海之间-03</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%B2%B3%E6%B8%AF%E4%B8%8E%E6%B5%B7%E4%B9%8B%E9%97%B4-04\" title=\"河港与海之间-04\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">河港与海之间</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">03</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E5.9B.9E.E6.97.8B.E6.9B.B2\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"回旋曲\">回旋曲</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 回旋曲</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">A Monotonous Rondo</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"><div class=\"tabber-filter-item selected\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"1\" style=\"padding:8px 4px; margin-bottom:-8px;\"><div class=\"episode-nav-item episode-nav-battle\"><i class=\"selected-icon\"><img alt=\"选中\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/20px-Img_xuanzhong.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"选中\" width=\"20\" height=\"19\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/30px-Img_xuanzhong.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/40px-Img_xuanzhong.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"48\" data-file-height=\"46\" /></i>演奏前</div></div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"2\" style=\"padding:8px 4px; margin-bottom:-8px;\"><div class=\"episode-nav-item episode-nav-battle\"><i class=\"selected-icon\"><img alt=\"选中\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/20px-Img_xuanzhong.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"选中\" width=\"20\" height=\"19\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/30px-Img_xuanzhong.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/40px-Img_xuanzhong.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"48\" data-file-height=\"46\" /></i>演奏后</div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"tabber-item tabber\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"1\"><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong\"><img alt=\"1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4f/Cg-1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong.png/600px-Cg-1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4f/Cg-1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong.png/900px-Cg-1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4f/Cg-1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong.png/1200px-Cg-1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿母亲：</div><div>感谢各位肯抽出时间前来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿母亲：</div><div>这次展示中所用的小提琴只是一些样品，下个月我们将正式举办演奏会。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿母亲：</div><div>任何疑问或建议，还请尽情提出。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿母亲：</div><div>一把贴合使用者演奏习惯的琴，才是最好的琴。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>商人，音乐家，收藏家，几位好奇的研究者。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这栋房子从来不缺热情的访客。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿母亲：</div><div>噢，费代里戈实在没空，作坊的事情老是绊住他……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿母亲：</div><div>您想订琴，得找他商量……我们有几位学徒手艺也不错，要是一定让他自个儿来，恐怕得等几天了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿母亲：</div><div>我也不知道具体的日子。他这几周吃住都在作坊里，只回来取过一次东西……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女主人流畅地应对着各种各样的提问。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>而房间的一角，小小的身影正屏住呼吸，等待着属于她的时机。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"520913.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-520913.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-520913.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"520913.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-520913.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-520913.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-520913.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-520913.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>还没开始演奏展示，我都要睡着了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"520912.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-520912.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-520912.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"520912.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-520912.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-520912.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-520912.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-520912.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>他们就没有哪回认真听过“啪唧匣子”奏出的乐曲，总说朋友们的夸奖只是为了让我开心。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"520912.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-520912.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-520912.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"520912.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-520912.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-520912.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-520912.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-520912.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>这次陌生人的反应总能算数吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>蜷缩在柜子里的小姑娘把琴身往怀里紧了紧，注意着不让它受到磕碰。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"513901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-513901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-513901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"513901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-513901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-513901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-513901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-513901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿母亲：</div><div>阿玛蒂型的琴会更加柔和、古典而纯粹，能够表现出泉水般的音色。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"513901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-513901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-513901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"513901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-513901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-513901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-513901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-513901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿母亲：</div><div>但如果您偏爱更为明亮的声音，那么接下来的演奏应当会使您满意。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"513901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-513901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-513901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"513901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-513901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-513901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-513901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-513901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿母亲：</div><div>斯特拉迪瓦里家族的琴在这方面从未辜负它的名声。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>几位学徒已经将琴在肩膀上架好。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女主人的话音刚刚落下，悠扬的旋律立刻紧随其后。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"612301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-612301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-612301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"612301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-612301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-612301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-612301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-612301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">收藏家：</div><div>不错，真不错，在音乐厅里也一定能听得清。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"612301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-612301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-612301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"612301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-612301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-612301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-612301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-612301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">收藏家：</div><div>它倾斜的琴颈真是漂亮。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"615501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-615501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-615501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"615501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"25\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-615501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-615501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-615501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-615501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"126\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">商人：</div><div>我手里正好有个乐团的单子，看样子他们会喜欢……哪怕等上一年半载也行。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>趁着人们低声说话的工夫，新的音符悄然汇入这阵洪流。</div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"tabber-item tabber\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"2\"><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"612301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-612301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-612301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"612301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-612301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-612301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-612301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-612301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">收藏家：</div><div>噢，多么新颖呀！在小提琴之余，我们确实需要一些别的音色作为调剂。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"562220.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-562220.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-562220.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"562220.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-562220.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-562220.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-562220.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-562220.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">音乐家：</div><div>当然，朋友们！——年轻的孩子们正需要类似的小游戏来培养乐感。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"612301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-612301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-612301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"612301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-612301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-612301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-612301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-612301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">收藏家：</div><div>哈哈，谁没有这种时候呢～</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>乐曲宣告结束，紧接着是持续的、热情的掌声。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女主人也象征性地献上了几句称赞。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"615501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-615501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-615501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"615501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"25\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-615501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-615501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-615501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-615501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"126\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">商人：</div><div>看来这是为大伙儿准备的惊喜。这下我可真要咬咬牙再多订几把琴了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"615501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-615501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-615501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"615501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"25\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-615501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-615501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-615501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-615501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"126\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">商人：</div><div>要是方便，兴许您愿意介绍这位不愿露面的演奏家……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿母亲：</div><div>实在抱歉，我总不太好为难对方。大家都知道这位年轻人有点儿怕生……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿母亲：</div><div>但我想你们会在下个月的演奏会见面的，先生。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"562220.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-562220.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-562220.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"562220.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-562220.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-562220.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-562220.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-562220.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">音乐家：</div><div>还是位年轻人！到时候我一定会准时赶到，女士。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>人们的议论逐渐远去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>黑暗中举起的手轻轻落在“啪唧匣子”上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"520910.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/45/HeadIconSmall-520910.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-520910.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"520910.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/45/HeadIconSmall-520910.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-520910.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/45/HeadIconSmall-520910.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-520910.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>果然，大家都很满意～</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"520912.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-520912.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-520912.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"520912.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-520912.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-520912.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-520912.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-520912.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>但这可不是什么小孩子的游戏！唔……说不准是因为这太突然了，下一次，我应该准备得再充分一些……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"520912.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-520912.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-520912.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"520912.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-520912.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-520912.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-520912.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-520912.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>就在——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>急促的脚步朝她靠近。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"513911.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-513911.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-513911.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"513911.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-513911.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-513911.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-513911.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-513911.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿母亲：</div><div>出来，芭卡洛儿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"513911.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-513911.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-513911.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"513911.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-513911.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-513911.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-513911.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-513911.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿母亲：</div><div>你学过的礼仪都被丢干净了吗？这种鬼鬼祟祟的行为，谁家孩子会这么做？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"520911.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/32/HeadIconSmall-520911.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-520911.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"520911.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/32/HeadIconSmall-520911.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-520911.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/32/HeadIconSmall-520911.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-520911.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"513911.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-513911.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-513911.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"513911.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-513911.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-513911.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-513911.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-513911.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿母亲：</div><div>逃掉训练课，跑去港口浪费时间，还有，你上次在作坊里做的琴弓根本不合格……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"513911.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-513911.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-513911.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"513911.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-513911.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-513911.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-513911.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-513911.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿母亲：</div><div>你再聪明又有什么用？斯特拉迪瓦里家族的聪明人还不够多吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"520912.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-520912.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-520912.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"520912.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-520912.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-520912.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-520912.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-520912.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>那支琴弓是特制的！是试着做给“啪唧匣子”的——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿母亲：</div><div>别找借口了，快出来！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"520913.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-520913.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-520913.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"520913.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-520913.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-520913.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-520913.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-520913.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>我……等等……妈咪！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"520911.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/32/HeadIconSmall-520911.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-520911.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"520911.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/32/HeadIconSmall-520911.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-520911.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/32/HeadIconSmall-520911.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-520911.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>Astrictus……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在紧要关头，粘合咒无情地抛弃了她。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这不过是她许多次失败的尝试中，又一次微不足道的失手。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>母亲的手握住了她的手腕，将她和“啪唧匣子”一起拽了出来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>好吧，对不起，妈咪……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>可是那些客人都很喜欢我的演奏！我听见他们的掌声了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>您说过，人们只会称赞真正好的东西，他们不是夸奖那段旋律了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>我不想永远只听见小提琴。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>不合时宜的真心话。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿母亲：</div><div>……让我看看你的琴。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿母亲：</div><div>为什么犹豫？要信任自己的作品，连这点你都忘记了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这与作坊里的每把琴都不同，它不再适用于“小提琴”这样的分类。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>格格不入，怪模怪样，琴颈的木头与一支单簧管难舍难分。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"513910.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-513910.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-513910.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"513910.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-513910.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-513910.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-513910.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-513910.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿母亲：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"513901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-513901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-513901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"513901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-513901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-513901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-513901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-513901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿母亲：</div><div>我和你的父亲挑选了最好的云杉和枫木，找到年轮紧密均匀的木头并不容易。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"513901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-513901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-513901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"513901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-513901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-513901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-513901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-513901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿母亲：</div><div>它的琴漆也是我至今为止调配得最好的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"513901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-513901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-513901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"513901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-513901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-513901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-513901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-513901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿母亲：</div><div>我们想给你准备最特别的礼物，最适合你，最受你喜爱……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"513901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-513901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-513901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"513901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-513901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-513901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-513901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-513901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿母亲：</div><div>你喜欢它吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"520901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/89/HeadIconSmall-520901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-520901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"520901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/89/HeadIconSmall-520901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-520901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/89/HeadIconSmall-520901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-520901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>是的，妈妈。它有名字，它是我最心爱的“啪唧匣子”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"513901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-513901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-513901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"513901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-513901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-513901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-513901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-513901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿母亲：</div><div>以你的年纪而言，做得还算不错。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"513901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-513901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-513901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"513901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-513901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-513901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-513901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-513901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿母亲：</div><div>拿好它。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>母亲的举动出乎她的意料，原本想好的解释全都溜得不见踪影。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>最终，她也只能小声发问。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>你不生气了，妈妈？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>你们终于认可我的想法了——太好啦！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿母亲：</div><div>我没有生你的气，芭卡洛儿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>母亲的话语仍然轻柔。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿母亲：</div><div>我对你很失望。我本以为你足够优秀，能继承家族的作坊，或是成为一名优秀的音乐家……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿母亲：</div><div>谁会认可“啪唧匣子”呢？谁会购买这样的乐器，又有谁会始终去听它的演奏呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿母亲：</div><div>你能让克雷莫纳的人们认可你，能用它通过快到来的家族考试吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿母亲：</div><div>离开斯特拉迪瓦里的名号，还会有这样多的人为你送上掌声吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一连串平静的疑问浇灭了小姑娘脸上的笑容。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>我不是为了被称赞才演奏的！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>你们……你们只在乎小提琴，难道克雷莫纳就永远都会是小提琴之都？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>制琴作坊的生意没有过去那么好了，妈妈，街上的作坊在减少，您真的没发现吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>为什么就不能做出比调整琴形、调整琴漆配方再多一点的改变？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭卡洛儿：</div><div>难道我们要一直这样，直到被外面的世界完全抛下吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她抛下同样连珠炮般的疑问，几乎是逃出了房间。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这是今天的第二次失败。</div></div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "河港与海之间-03"}}